   "skill": {
    "name": "commit",
    "title": {
     "zh-CN": "确认后提交",
     "en": "Commit after confirmation"
    },
    "summary": {
     "zh-CN": "准备一次本地 Git 提交：挑出属于这次改动的文件、检查凭据、按仓库风格起草提交信息，把清单与命令给你看，你确认后才执行 git add 与 git commit。二次开发自 Anthropic 官方 Claude Code 插件 commit-commands 的 /commit：只暂存明确路径，提交前检查凭据文件与凭据样式内容，不推送、不修订、不跳过钩子，无人值守的 AI 同事任务只交提交方案。",
     "en": "Prepares one local Git commit: picks the files of the change, checks for credentials, drafts a message in the repository's style and shows you the list and commands; git add and git commit run only after you confirm. Derived from /commit in Anthropic's Claude Code plugin commit-commands: explicit paths only, a credential check first, no push, amend or hook bypass, and unattended AI colleague tasks hand over the proposal."
    }
   },
