      "en": "Needs a capable model: in one attended run a local qwen3:14b wrote files before the user approved an approach and skipped the approach comparison and review; in 3 unattended runs it wrote a file once. Use a capable model and keep writes under the host's per-call confirmation. Not validated end to end in a Teloa host."
