       "en": "Teloa has no Claude Code Task tool and no plugin-registered named subagents; whether an AI colleague can delegate depends on whether its role was granted the one-off delegation tool (subagent_task), so the text says to delegate when possible and otherwise work in turn, and drops model tiers in favour of the host's configured model."
