      "en": "Verified with a real model (DeepSeek deepseek-flash, isolated test environment) on 2026-09-26: added from the market, loaded into a business, code review collaborator on duty; all three templates (PR review, release notes, issue triage) matched the expected structure, each comment traced to a file line or number; nothing was posted, approved, merged or relabelled. PR reviews can be stricter than the sample, so the owner confirms the verdict."
