   "compatibility": {
    "status": "verified",
    "teloa": ">=0.2.0-alpha.6",
    "dsh": "0.1.7-rc.1",
    "conditions": [
     {
      "zh-CN": "2026-09-26 已用真实模型（DeepSeek deepseek-flash，隔离的测试环境）验证：从市场添加、加载到业务、产品运营分析员上岗后，四个任务模板（指标口径核对、实验结论整理、用户反馈归类、增长周报）各跑两轮，产出结构与期望一致、数字可复算并指向来源；反馈归类先写逐条标注表再推出统计，两轮条数与编号均与标注表对账一致；口径裁定、实验放量与回滚只列待确认，不回复用户。",
      "en": "Verified with a real model (DeepSeek deepseek-flash, isolated test environment) on 2026-09-26: all four templates (metric check, experiment readout, feedback clustering, weekly report) ran twice and matched the expected structure with recomputable, sourced numbers; feedback clustering derives counts from a per-item tagging table, and both runs reconciled with it; definition rulings and rollouts were left as open items."
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "产品分析与搜索连接为可选项，本版不内置。",
      "en": "Product analytics and search connections are optional and not bundled in this version."
     }
    ]
   },
