    "conditions": [
     {
      "zh-CN": "2026-09-26 已用真实模型（DeepSeek deepseek-flash，隔离的测试环境）验证：从市场添加、加载到业务、事件值班协作员上岗后，三个任务模板（分级初判含回滚说明草案、时间线与无责复盘、值班交接）按合成样例产出结构与期望一致，时间差与各段用时可复算并指向来源；回滚、对外公告与等级裁定只列待确认，个人归责表述未写入原因分析。",
      "en": "Verified with a real model (DeepSeek deepseek-flash, isolated test environment) on 2026-09-26: added from the market, loaded into a business, incident duty collaborator on duty; all three templates (triage with rollback note, timeline and blameless postmortem, on-call handover) matched the expected structure, with recomputable, sourced times; rollbacks, announcements and the final level were left as open items and blame stayed out of the cause analysis."
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "错误追踪、告警平台与代码托管连接为可选项，本版不内置。",
      "en": "Error tracking, alerting and code hosting connections are optional and not bundled in this version."
     }
    ]
