      "en": "Verified with a real model (DeepSeek deepseek-flash, isolated test environment) on 2026-09-25: ticket triage, FAQ distillation and escalation summary matched the expected structure on synthetic samples; reply drafts cite fact-base entries with wording checks, escalated tickets get no outbound draft, personal data reduced to ticket ids."
